WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,670 --> 00:00:03,570
Fan Jiawen

2
00:00:03,710 --> 00:00:04,980
Fan Jiawen, wake up

3
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:06,580
Sister Wang Brother Liu

4
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:10,260
You killed my brother

5
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:13,580
I want you to live long and die

6
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:15,020
You go to hell

7
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:17,890
It was you who thought first and then killed us.

8
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:21,980
Then you are not allowed to kill him

9
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:23,660
Why kill him?

10
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:31,140
You, you are so unreasonable, Sister Wang.

11
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:32,740
Fan Jiawen

12
00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:35,940
I've survived my whole life

13
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:52,240
How could he die here? Xiao Fan Xiao Fan Lidong Xiao Qing Xiao Lan came over to help

14
00:00:56,670 --> 00:00:58,070
Xiao Fan, nothing can happen to you.

15
00:00:58,800 --> 00:00:59,840
What's wrong with that man?
